{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["The sense of <b>when you lift its fat</b>. Scripture has already mentioned this to attach after it 'and you shall eat it.' The meaning is that it is forbidden to you to eat of it until you lift its fat from it, and after it is reckoned to you, then you may eat it in any pure place."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:18:19.579215916Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}